OL,3,ASexual assaults happening almost every
OL,4,Aday in Ceuta, prosecutors say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 72,000 migrants crossed from
OL,7,FMorocco into Ceuta on 30 and 31 July
OL,8,Fand although most have returned, as
OL,9,Fmany as 5,000 remain - leading to
OL,10,Funrest in the autonomous city in North
OL,11,FAfrica and a crisis for Spanish Prime
OL,12,FMinister Pedro Sanchez.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
